// BT-3704: a sealed class with no class state whose `class sealed` methods are
// direct-called in the caller's process (ADR 0129 Phase 0b), so a block passed
// in runs at home.

sealed Object subclass: CvsSealedDriver

  class sealed each: aBlock => aBlock value

  class sealed guard: aBlock => [aBlock value] on: Error do: [:e | nil]
